            <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Pfahlgründung für Spree-Grundwasser</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Wesemann-Gruppe · 60+ Jahre Laborbau</div>
